      "lines": [
        "16. 等差数列前$n$项的和的公式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设需要求出前100个自然数的和. 直接将这些数相加",
        "可以得到答案. 但是，这种解决办法是很费力的. 现在我们",
        "试图按另一个方式求出需要的结果."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把从1到100的自然数的和写两次，一种是按照递",
        "增的顺序排列加数，而另一种是按照递减的顺序排列加数. 就",
        "是：",
        "$1+2+3+\\cdots+98+99+100$，",
        "$100+99+98+\\cdots+3+2+1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "容易看出，上下排着的两个数的和是相同的：",
        "$1+100=2+99=3+98=\\cdots=98+3↵=99+2=100+1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每两个数的和都是101，共有100个数对. 因此",
        "$1+2+3+\\cdots+98+99+100↵=\\frac{101\\times100}{2}=101\\times50=5050$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们利用类似的方法推出等差数列前$n$项的和的公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用$S_n$表示等差数列$(a_n)$前$n$项的和，并且把这个和",
        "写两次，第二次把加数的顺序换成相反的顺序：",
        "$S_n=a_1+a_2+a_3+\\cdots+a_{n-2}+a_{n-1}+a_n$， （1）",
        "$S_n=a_n+a_{n-1}+a_{n-2}+\\cdots+a_3+a_2+a_1$. （2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将所得等式（1）和（2）相加，就得：",
        "$2S_n=(a_1+a_n)+(a_2+a_{n-1})+(a_3+a_{n-2})+\\cdots↵+(a_{n-2}+a_3)+(a_{n-1}+a_2)+(a_n+a_1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
